Package: ricoh-sp211su-driver
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cups, libsane1, libusb-1.0-0, libcups2t64 | libcups2
Maintainer: Sento <sento@local>
Description: Complete Linux driver for Ricoh Aficio SP 211SU (Printer & Scanner)
 Provides full printing and scanning support for Ricoh Aficio SP 211SU (USB 05ca:044f).
 Includes:
  - Primax 64-bit DDST CUPS raster filter (rastertolilo)
  - Official Ricoh SP-211 PPD model definition
  - Native SANE backend (libsane-ricoh2) with USB FIFO buffer and RGB support
  - udev permissions rules for scanner access
  - Automated CUPS queue setup helper utility (ricoh-sp211su-setup)
